    "detailed_description": "In this retro-themed arcade game bundle, play as the eponymous Brucie and single-handedly perform all major ends of restaurant management!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe four included games allow you to hone your skills, each with varying demands for focus and time:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Ingredient Run: An involved, time-limited challenge to find the most ingredients in an obstacle-laden environment riddled with hazards. Strategize a path to pick up point-multiplying powerups and capture evasive ingredients. <br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Cooking: A moderately intensive task in speedy memorization, where you must flip similarly patterned meat on a grill. Combat limited guesses by chaining matches.<br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Serving: A dynamic exercise of strategy to serve increasingly impatient guests. Balance relaxing moments of cleanup with stressful amounts of concurrent orders awaiting completion.<br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Stacking Leftovers: A chaotic test of reaction and endurance that places you in an unrelenting torrent of discarded leftovers, takeout boxes, hazards, and powerups. Dangers lurk beneath you as well: rats, rolling barrels, and fallen bombs are there to catch you off guard and impair your abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOr, if you have time to spare, immerse yourself in Marathon Mode: a back-to-back run of all four games with an accumulated score.",
    "about_the_game": "In this retro-themed arcade game bundle, play as the eponymous Brucie and single-handedly perform all major ends of restaurant management!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe four included games allow you to hone your skills, each with varying demands for focus and time:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Ingredient Run: An involved, time-limited challenge to find the most ingredients in an obstacle-laden environment riddled with hazards. Strategize a path to pick up point-multiplying powerups and capture evasive ingredients. <br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Cooking: A moderately intensive task in speedy memorization, where you must flip similarly patterned meat on a grill. Combat limited guesses by chaining matches.<br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Serving: A dynamic exercise of strategy to serve increasingly impatient guests. Balance relaxing moments of cleanup with stressful amounts of concurrent orders awaiting completion.<br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n- Stacking Leftovers: A chaotic test of reaction and endurance that places you in an unrelenting torrent of discarded leftovers, takeout boxes, hazards, and powerups. Dangers lurk beneath you as well: rats, rolling barrels, and fallen bombs are there to catch you off guard and impair your abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOr, if you have time to spare, immerse yourself in Marathon Mode: a back-to-back run of all four games with an accumulated score.",
    "short_description": "A retro arcade game bundle where you must manage a restaurant through four mini-games: Ingredient Run, Cooking, Serving, and Stacking Leftovers. Each game offers unique challenges packaged up in a familiar, replayable arcade format.",
